Bibi Pertama.

38:05.970 --> 38:06.700
Cepat cari tabib!

38:08.130 --> 38:09.010
Beri pertolongan pertama.

38:10.930 --> 38:11.530
- Ibu!
- Nyonya Xue!

38:12.820 --> 38:13.570
- Ibu!
- Nyonya Xue!

38:14.450 --> 38:15.410
