39:56.090 --> 39:56.610
Ayah!

39:56.610 --> 39:57.900
- Paman Xu!
- Ayah!

39:57.900 --> 39:59.050
- Aku mau kembalikan!
- Paman Xu!

39:59.050 --> 39:59.780
Kak Xu!

40:06.300 --> 40:08.130
